OL,3,AFrom cake to pizza: How to get the best
OL,4,Abirthday freebies (and why there's a
OL,5,Acatch)
OL,6,
OL,7,FMost chain coffee shops and bakeries
OL,8,Foffer a birthday treat through their
OL,9,Floyalty apps. You can get a free sweet
OL,10,Ftreat, usually a cake, cookie, muffin
OL,11,For doughnut, from Greggs, Costa, Caffe
OL,12,FNero, Krispy Kreme, Gail's, Subway and
OL,13,FOle & Steen if you have registered your
OL,14,Fdate of birth in advance.
OL,16,FLidl Plus members can claim a free
OL,17,Fbakery doughnut within seven days of
OL,18,Ftheir birthday, while M&S Sparks
OL,19,Fmembers can choose two gifts on their
OL,20,Fbirthday from a range of 15 which
OL,21,Fincludes cookies and chocolates.
